/**
 * @mainpage kaldi-hmm-gmm C++ API
 *
 * Kaldi's HMM-GMM reimplementation with Eigen: GMMs (diagonal covariance),
 * HMM topology and transition model, decision trees / context-dependency,
 * training-graph compilation, MLE/MAP updates, and GMM decodables for
 * forced alignment and decoding.
 *
 * Headers live in kaldi-hmm-gmm/csrc/ and are copied/modified from
 * kaldi/src/{gmm,hmm,tree,itf,...}.  The decoding engine (decoders,
 * decoder-wrappers, lattice best path) lives in the sibling project
 * kaldi-decoder (https://github.com/k2-fsa/kaldi-decoder); this library
 * links `kaldi-decoder-core` and implements its `DecodableInterface` /
 * `TransitionInformation`.
 *
 * See also the Python API documentation (package `kaldi_hmm_gmm`) and the
 * usage guides for the yesno recipe and MFA forced alignment.
 */
